		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4901&amp;p=35877#p35877"><![CDATA[
<ul><li> Add audio amp mute feature:    <ul>    <li> When the audio mute is enabled, the radio mode (FM/DMR) font is stroked.</li>    <li> Add "Mute: On/Off" in quick menus.</li>    <li> Use longpress '0' key for audio mute toggling.</li>    </ul></li><li> Some internal cleanups.</li></ul>The firmwares are available at: <a href="https://drive.proton.me/urls/ZE20CR9GQ4#XB1yGYYTvhga" class="postlink">https://drive.proton.me/urls/ZE20CR9GQ4#XB1yGYYTvhga</a><br>The voice prompts are available at: <a href="https://drive.proton.me/urls/D3JKT50X7M#Md1OQqCWViCJ" class="postlink">https://drive.proton.me/urls/D3JKT50X7M#Md1OQqCWViCJ</a><br><br><strong class="text-strong">NOTE</strong>: You <span style="text-decoration:underline">need</span> to use a CPS version greater or equal the the 2025/01/26. See the CPS section <a href="https://www.opengd77.com/viewforum.php?f=12" class="postlink">viewforum.php?f=12</a><br><br>For translators, the on-screen texts, voice prompts CSV are located at: <a href="https://drive.proton.me/urls/K6NBA7FRH0#owtc56LE34hj" class="postlink">https://drive.proton.me/urls/K6NBA7FRH0#owtc56LE34hj</a><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=56">F1RMB</a> — Sun Feb 23, 2025 12:12 pm</p><hr />
